700m long trend of gold-in-soil geochemical anomalies and coincident magnetic and IP anomalies; additional drilling will be required to determine the geometry and potential of these zones, as near-surface mineralization is relatively widespread."]},{"type":"p","children":["\"Results from the South-Pelham Zone suggest that gold grades are higher as the system goes deeper.\" Further deep drilling at both zones will determine the extent of mineralization to unlock its full potential, Ivy Chong added."]},{"type":"news-image","params":{"image":{"id":"tmx_newsfile:c5ab60cbe094b-54f09f46f3ca41f0fd35787c8b227ff8","source-width":849,"source-height":1088,"bg-color":"#b5939d"}}},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Figure 2: South-Pelham IP Plan Map"]}]},{"type":"p","children":["To view an enhanced version of this graphic, please visit:"]},{"type":"news-image","params":{"image":{"id":"tmx_newsfile:c5ab60cbe094b-54f09f46f3ca41f0fd35787c8b227ff8","source-width":849,"source-height":1088,"bg-color":"#b5939d"}}},{"type":"news-image","params":{"image":{"id":"tmx_newsfile:c5ab60cbe094b-67bf3e96081a90267de91746fbfec79a","source-width":1212,"source-height":576,"bg-color":"#7d7c7b"}}},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Figure 3: Pelham-South Long Section"]}]},{"type":"p","children":["To view an enhanced version of this graphic, please visit:"]},{"type":"news-image","params":{"image":{"id":"tmx_newsfile:c5ab60cbe094b-67bf3e96081a90267de91746fbfec79a","source-width":1212,"source-height":576,"bg-color":"#7d7c7b"}}},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Table 2: South-Pelham Drill Intercepts Highlights"]}]},{"type":"table","children":[{"type":"table-body","children":[{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Hole Number"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Targets"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Zone"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","chil